<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50578" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰο-βόλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shooting arrows</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.34
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Rhian.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>shedding venom, venomous</i>, of animals, <i><span class="en">
				Numen.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.304f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				3.9.5
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				17.5.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰοβόλα, τά</span>, <i>venomous animals</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				607a28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ ἰοβόλων ζῴων</span>,
			title of work by Philumenus; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν ἰ. ἄκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					3.44
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of arrows,
				<i>poisoned</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				12.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.237
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Demod.
			</span></i>): metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. γένυες</span>, of
			Momus, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.266.2
			</span></i>.</div>
